name latex4musicians
category Package
revision 49759
shortdesc A guide for combining LaTeX and music
longdesc This guide, "LaTeX for Musicians", explains how to create LaTeX
longdesc documents that include several kinds of music elements: music
longdesc symbols, song lyrics, guitar chords diagrams, lead sheets,
longdesc music excerpts, guitar tablatures, multi-page scores.
